        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "385724e3-abc6-3fcf-9eb3-0dd99a5fc3a1",
                "word": "applaudissement",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "9afdc1fd-c2a3-432d-949c-fa909ca07692",
                        "entry_id": "385724e3-abc6-3fcf-9eb3-0dd99a5fc3a1",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "applaudissements"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "32b38d13-5411-3c3d-a66c-8fd75364c5a2",
                        "entry_id": "385724e3-abc6-3fcf-9eb3-0dd99a5fc3a1",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Action d’applaudir."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4901a273-b5e2-4b2e-ade3-2281e5c5903f",
                                "sense_id": "32b38d13-5411-3c3d-a66c-8fd75364c5a2",
                                "text": "Des applaudissements unanimes, mais des applaudissements sourds, pour ainsi dire, les acclamations polies du faubourg Saint-Germain, témoignèrent de l’enthousiasme qu’elle excita."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f291ef8a-fed2-4803-855e-7a8ff8f1cc5f",
                                "sense_id": "32b38d13-5411-3c3d-a66c-8fd75364c5a2",
                                "text": "Soudain, au milieu de l’applaudissement général, un mouton rôti tout entier apparut, porté à bout de bras par un nègre vigoureux, sur un vaste plat de bois. Le méchoui, rissolé à point, exhalait une fumée odorante."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "354f688d-0b48-4fee-95ad-1e0d53576f42",
                                "sense_id": "32b38d13-5411-3c3d-a66c-8fd75364c5a2",
                                "text": "Dans les salles cinématographiques de Mars, après les massacres de Kitnicheff, les scènes de la guerre balkanique récoltaient le plus d’applaudissements. Tout le monde s’efforçait de découvrir la signification de ces charivaris effarants."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "75f06f87-6600-478a-877a-20613849143a",
                                "sense_id": "32b38d13-5411-3c3d-a66c-8fd75364c5a2",
                                "text": "Car les applaudissements ont deux sens : ils disent quelquefois le bonheur d’avoir été conquis ou celui, tout aussi grand, d’avoir enfin fini de s’ennuyer."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "473813fa-712f-3ab7-8652-e4f96845c09c",
                        "entry_id": "385724e3-abc6-3fcf-9eb3-0dd99a5fc3a1",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Louange, encouragement."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "188c5722-d0af-46bc-9844-f741e4265b8e",
                                "sense_id": "473813fa-712f-3ab7-8652-e4f96845c09c",
                                "text": "Ne fallait-il pas plutôt prendre le parti de le louer ? Il y avait dans cet homme perdu un ancien désir d’exceller dans une certaine région de la vie, que l’applaudissement aurait pu redresser…"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "964266c4-beb4-4261-a745-ef2080a1f6e1",
                        "source_entry_id": "385724e3-abc6-3fcf-9eb3-0dd99a5fc3a1",
                        "source_sense_description": "Action d’applaudir",
                        "target_lang_word": "Applaus",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Applaus",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "11e78825-9c57-3d27-90c8-f83607bbf9cc",
                                        "entry_id": "51ae69c9-2548-3e71-898f-81f649761eaa",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Beifallsbekundung, insbesondere durch Klatschen mit den Händen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3cb5b1b6-234e-4135-85c2-08997e1de518",
                                                "sense_id": "11e78825-9c57-3d27-90c8-f83607bbf9cc",
                                                "text": "Als der Violinvirtuose sich mehrmals verneigte, wurde er mit Applaus überschüttet."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d2c5185e-8766-4c5f-92de-d3844c85035a",
                                                "sense_id": "11e78825-9c57-3d27-90c8-f83607bbf9cc",
                                                "text": "„Also beschlossen wir, uns ebenfalls nicht lumpen zu lassen, gaben am Abend alles, was wir hatten, und bekamen am Ende unverhofft starken Applaus.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c5b4ca74-b498-403a-bc68-4bf6d14aeec4",
                                                "sense_id": "11e78825-9c57-3d27-90c8-f83607bbf9cc",
                                                "text": "„Der Applaus wurde noch heftiger.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "74f3d25d-3b14-4ee9-b522-ced2301bd0a3",
                                                "sense_id": "11e78825-9c57-3d27-90c8-f83607bbf9cc",
                                                "text": "„Achtmal unterbricht der Applaus Lumumbas Ansprache.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6ba2e918-21da-4442-bab4-b6b24dccf3f7",
                                                "sense_id": "11e78825-9c57-3d27-90c8-f83607bbf9cc",
                                                "text": "„Unter tosendem Applaus betrat eine Sopransängerin die Bühne.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fba0627a-5900-4368-be0c-afe5c960cac5",
                        "source_entry_id": "385724e3-abc6-3fcf-9eb3-0dd99a5fc3a1",
                        "source_sense_description": "Action d’applaudir",
                        "target_lang_word": "Beifall",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Beifall",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1f55c373-f4ed-338b-8b7d-75fd16463e60",
                                        "entry_id": "6036b42a-2713-3ffd-adba-5e268aeec031",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "akustische Bekundung von Zustimmung und Gefallen einer Darbietung"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f7eb194f-de5d-41cf-9397-17aede186d37",
                                                "sense_id": "1f55c373-f4ed-338b-8b7d-75fd16463e60",
                                                "text": "Das Publikum spendete lang anhaltenden, nicht enden wollenden und durch Hochrufe unterbrochenen Beifall."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "978530e8-aed5-4494-b547-3fd3cc1703f0",
                                                "sense_id": "1f55c373-f4ed-338b-8b7d-75fd16463e60",
                                                "text": "„Beinah hätte ich Beifall geklatscht.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1ae58d56-784c-4995-a0fe-dbe5646245ac",
                                                "sense_id": "1f55c373-f4ed-338b-8b7d-75fd16463e60",
                                                "text": "„So brachte ich sie dahin, sich selbst Beifall zu zollen, daß sie den Weg der Nachgiebigkeit gewählt hatte.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "de7fdf30-bb09-4f6c-bd1a-7a7e1944fdcc",
                                                "sense_id": "1f55c373-f4ed-338b-8b7d-75fd16463e60",
                                                "text": "„Ein lebhafter Beifall blieb nicht aus.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "28a09ee5-9064-4e6b-87bf-9dd791f2adb7",
                                                "sense_id": "1f55c373-f4ed-338b-8b7d-75fd16463e60",
                                                "text": "„Der Zögling nickte Beifall zu.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ec7387e5-de4e-40f9-ba8c-ebcb06cd6c16",
                        "source_entry_id": "385724e3-abc6-3fcf-9eb3-0dd99a5fc3a1",
                        "source_sense_description": "Action d’applaudir",
                        "target_lang_word": "Händeklatschen",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Händeklatschen",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2235480a-cd9e-3bea-94bc-0c2ca4b91736",
                                        "entry_id": "296873ab-118a-3b82-8f37-e497ba07a454",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Zusammenschlagen der Hände, zum Beispiel um Beifall zu bekunden"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0ba5e139-6487-4932-9c59-108d916efe21",
                                                "sense_id": "2235480a-cd9e-3bea-94bc-0c2ca4b91736",
                                                "text": "„So verkleidet gingen wir in den Saal hinunter, wo uns allgemeines Händeklatschen sogleich die gute Laune wiedergab.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5ed1caf5-4705-4177-a68d-bad69493232e",
                        "source_entry_id": "385724e3-abc6-3fcf-9eb3-0dd99a5fc3a1",
                        "source_sense_description": "Action d’applaudir",
                        "target_lang_word": "applause",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "applause",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4cd6c6ed-805c-3038-a0bd-a528d04b40ae",
                                        "entry_id": "6ab18e25-016a-3e5e-9e88-f4ad2705af84",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of applauding; approbation and praise publicly expressed by the clapping of hands, stamping or tapping of the feet, acclamation, huzzas, or other means; marked commendation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9fb97a9c-90a7-4745-bde8-10b6757c1bf0",
                                                "sense_id": "4cd6c6ed-805c-3038-a0bd-a528d04b40ae",
                                                "text": "A few days before, the adulations and applauses of a nation were sounding in her [Marie Louise, Duchess of Parma's] ears, and now she was come to this!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2a20e275-07ae-42ff-86ad-c9065f68d93a",
                                                "sense_id": "4cd6c6ed-805c-3038-a0bd-a528d04b40ae",
                                                "text": "Lestrade and I sat silent for a moment, and then, with a spontaneous impulse, we both broke at clapping, as at the well-wrought crisis of a play. […] It was at such moments that for an instant he [Sherlock Holmes] ceased to be a reasoning machine, and betrayed his human love for admiration and applause."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d89dab6f-16ed-48ae-9dd2-520f1ae3d5f8",
                                                "sense_id": "4cd6c6ed-805c-3038-a0bd-a528d04b40ae",
                                                "text": "Livy never gets her share of those applauses, but it is because the people do not know. Yet she is entitled to the lion's share."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "50a7de32-bd18-43ee-a7c5-fc79742c1c58",
                                                "sense_id": "4cd6c6ed-805c-3038-a0bd-a528d04b40ae",
                                                "text": "Rice’s celebrations upon his goal were controlled, muted. Not so those of Grealish, who lapped up the applause of the England fans behind the goal."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "applause",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e4f5ad01-c4c3-3359-a962-217d7c26f07e",
                                        "entry_id": "eb496836-4b36-3535-ade0-8fe1c60a3df3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To applaud."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8df8a5b5-0ee0-42ad-afcb-1c3a1ad56398",
                                                "sense_id": "e4f5ad01-c4c3-3359-a962-217d7c26f07e",
                                                "text": "But (which had ſcarrefide our wounds, if wounded, with the Balme / Of her ſweete Preſence, ſo applaus’d as in Sea-ſtormes a Calme) / Her royall-ſelfe, Elizabeth our Soueraigne lawfull Queene, / In magnanimious Maieſtie amidſt her Troupes was ſeene."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "63616e77-29b1-4a9c-a7a3-b2146afb9f27",
                                                "sense_id": "e4f5ad01-c4c3-3359-a962-217d7c26f07e",
                                                "text": "Now Ahab ſees the ground of that applauſed conſent of his rabble of Prophets: […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1a00905d-1ee1-4775-b9f2-5277559fcbac",
                                                "sense_id": "e4f5ad01-c4c3-3359-a962-217d7c26f07e",
                                                "text": "O ſacred Emperour, theſe ears have heard, / What no Sons ears can unrevenged hear, / The Princes all of them, but ſpecially, / The Prince Elector Archbiſhop of Collen, / Revil’d him by the names of murderer, / Arch villain, robber of the Empires fame, / And Cæſars tutor in all wickedneſs, / And with a general voice applaus’d his death, / As for a ſpecial good to Chriſtendome."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
